  "image": "/images/posts/11645.webp",
  "content": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"✅\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t33/1/16/2705.png\"/> El alcalde Nabih Soza, junto a la directora del DESAM, Vanessa Oyarzún, profesionales de SECPLAN y el administrador municipal, sostuvo una reunión con autoridades del Ministerio de Salud para gestionar iniciativas que permitan fortalecer la red de salud de la comuna.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🏥\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t7b/1/16/1f3e5.png\"/> Entre las principales prioridades se encuentran:</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">• Construcción del nuevo CESFAM de Maullín.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">• Recuperación de una quinta plaza de médicos EDF para reforzar la atención en la Ribera Norte.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">• Implementación de telemedicina en las postas rurales.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">• Creación de un dispositivo especializado en salud mental.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">• Financiamiento permanente para la Sala TEA.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">• Obtención de un Código DEIS transitorio para el Centro de Salud Maullín.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">• Incorporación de una unidad de diálisis en el proyecto de normalización del Hospital de Maullín.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🤝\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t64/1/16/1f91d.png\"/> Desde el municipio señalaron que continuarán realizando gestiones ante el Ministerio de Salud para concretar estas iniciativas, con el propósito de fortalecer la Atención Primaria y mejorar el acceso a una atención oportuna y de calidad para las vecinas y vecinos de la comuna.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">fuente comunicaciones munimaullin.cl</p>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-11648\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/aspy0sk22bfa0h3/hemodialisis_640_ykkzzfw40q.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:800px;height:auto\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-75 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-11656\" data-id=\"11656\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/14837payn8te4u0/587604734_10238196890199342_7664154490913974728_n_1024x678_zcie00dtdx.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-11650\" data-id=\"11650\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/b9f1leszp87bwnm/587700339_10238196855838483_7044123632690348768_n_1024x683_pr0b976ja1.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-11654\" data-id=\"11654\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/cswc6iazn9gnddq/658970737_10240116306583552_796583580663151823_n_1024x683_deqva7uy0n.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-11652\" data-id=\"11652\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/prbetjrgua3j5yx/734783750_10241332292022428_130438328481440422_n_1024x678_ix3m4tk1ku.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-11653\" data-id=\"11653\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/whiezfnf7lb7x9k/735844521_2186431718867717_8046302444401291637_n_1024x683_g91srjc8yk.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-11655\" data-id=\"11655\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/3o2rtdmr2empch7/desam_vacuna_17_1536x1080_1_1024x720_xqps96yl3c.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-11657\" data-id=\"11657\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/g89xge35afa14ft/quenuir_posta_04_1536x1024_1_1024x683_qvqf6s0c32.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-11651\" data-id=\"11651\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinult